<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's doubles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge (Australia)/Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat</p>
<p>9-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden)/Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 2-6 6-2 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Wayne Black (Zimbabwe)/Jim Grabb (U.S.) beat 12-Donald Johnson</p>
<p>(U.S.)/Francisco Montana (U.S.) 6-4 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>13-Martin Damm (Czech Republic)/Pavel Vizner (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>beat 11-Neil Broad (Britain)/Piet Norval (South Africa) 4-6 4-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>2-Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands)/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat</p>
<p>7-Mark Philippoussis (Australia)/Patrick Rafter (Australia) 4-6</p>
<p>7-5 3-6 6-3 10-8</p>
</text>
